cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MotherTongueIndex, please cite it as below."
title: "MotherTongueIndex: A Multilingual Tokenizer Efficiency Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  MotherTongueIndex measures how efficiently the tokenizers of mainstream large
  language models encode text in any language, anchored to English. It reports
  fertility, single-token retention, bytes per token, and a derived
  reasoning-capability impact from effective-context loss, distinguishing exact
  counts from labelled estimates. It is a subproject of Project Bornomala.
type: software
